 15px;\">Trail Curto<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: Consultar organiza\u00e7\u00e3o<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">13,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 09\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: Sem fins competitivos<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">9,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 09\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Rota do Sal 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Rota do Sal 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida marcada para as 09:00 na localidade de Pinheiro de \u00c1zere, no concelho de Santa Comba D\u00e3o, distrito de Viseu.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Rota do Sal 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra tr\u00eas modalidades: Trail Longo com o valor de 16,00 \u20ac, Trail Curto por 13,00 \u20ac e Caminhada por 9,00 \u20ac. O prazo limite de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e pagamento encerra na ter\u00e7a-feira, 9 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, \u00e0s 23:59.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e o contacto de apoio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela equipa Pinheiro de \u00c1zere Running Team (PDARunners) em parceria com a Junta de Freguesia de Pinheiro de \u00c1zere, disponibilizando o contacto telef\u00f3nico 969 910 047 para esclarecimentos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que tipo de terreno caracteriza o percurso em Pinheiro de \u00c1zere?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os percursos desenvolvem-se por trilhos florestais ondulantes, caminhos rurais centen\u00e1rios das antigas rotas do sal e zonas ribeirinhas junto \u00e0s margens e praias fluviais da albufeira da Barragem da Aguieira.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial ligada ao bot\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o desta p\u00e1gina, selecionando a dist\u00e2ncia pretendida (Trail Longo, Trail Curto ou Caminhada) e regularizando o pagamento at\u00e9 9 de mar\u00e7o de 2027.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Rota do Sal 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pinheiro de \u00c1zere, Santa Comba D\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santa Comba D\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Rota do Sal 2027 realiza-se a 14 de mar\u00e7o em Pinheiro de \u00c1zere, Santa Comba D\u00e3o (Viseu). Provas de Trail Longo, Trail Curto, Caminhada e inscri\u00e7\u00f5es!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/01\/TRS-26-Cartaz.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4536\/info\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4536\/info\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada\", \"price\": \"9.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4536\/info\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Pinheiro de \u00c1zere Running Team (PDARunners) e Junta de Freguesia de Pinheiro de \u00c1zere\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Rota do Sal 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Rota do Sal 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida marcada para as 09:00 na localidade de Pinheiro de \u00c1